      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>181</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>327</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
